   "text": "A reality where life perfected itself into permanence. Forests of glass and gold; growth that keeps everything it makes. A Verdant city is a single tree grown patient for ten thousand years. Its people did not defeat death; they out-remembered it. War doctrine: keep everything, forget nothing, grow until the question of victory answers itself. Its anchor in Limen is the palace-tree."
